": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215324000", "author": {"steamid": "76561198297869920", "personaname": "Cr4zzy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198297869920/", "num_games_owned": 306, "num_reviews": 87, "playtime_forever": 140, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 140, "last_played": 1761775410, "avatar": "7b767d7f1d59649d7b2ce7e675c85ce0859ae7dd"}, "language": "english", "review": "cloudy with a chance of rain is great but i would get risk of rain returns if i were you, unless you cant afford it", "timestamp_created": 1767715006, "timestamp_updated": 1767715006, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215261503", "author": {"steamid": "76561199025497003", "personaname": "Dan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199025497003/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 774, "playtime_forever": 140, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 140, "last_played": 1764426522, "avatar": "0c0ac8f1eff954d665925aacdd1952a48b7afd50"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain (2013) is one of those games that looks simple at first, then slowly reveals how deep and tense it can get. The basic idea is easy to understand: land on a hostile planet, find the teleporter, survive the waves, and move on. The catch is that time is always working against you, and the longer you stay, the more the game turns into controlled chaos.\n\nThe time-based difficulty is the feature that defines everything. You’re constantly deciding whether to keep exploring for items or rush the teleporter before enemies become ridiculous. That pressure creates a really satisfying loop where every run feels like a chain of risk/reward choices instead of a relaxed scavenger hunt.\n\nItem building is where the fun really starts. Pickups stack and interact in ways that can turn you from “barely surviving” into an unstoppable screen-clearing machine. At the same time, the game is happy to humble you instantly if your build is weak or your positioning slips for even a second.\n\nEach survivor plays differently enough to keep runs fresh. Some characters reward careful spacing, others want you to dive in and delete targets fast, and learning their strengths changes how you approach the same maps. It’s not just cosmetic variety—you genuinely have to adapt your movement and priorities.\n\nThe pixel art has a gritty charm, and the effects are surprisingly readable once you get used to the visual noise. Music is a big highlight too: it sells the lonely sci-fi atmosphere while still keeping the pace intense when things escalate. The whole presentation feels cohesive and memorable even by modern standards.\n\nIt can be rough around the edges compared to newer roguelites. Some deaths feel sudden, some enemies scale into absurdity, and certain runs can be decided by luck more than you’d like. But that unpredictability is also part of the identity: the game isn’t trying to be perfectly “fair,” it’s trying to keep you nervous.\n\nOverall, Risk of Rain is highly recommended if you enjoy roguelikes where momentum matters and every minute makes the world more dangerous. It’s challenging, fast, and addictive, with that special feeling of runs spiraling from “I’m fine” to “everything is exploding” in seconds. If you can handle occasional unfair moments and like learning through repeated attempts, it’s still absolutely worth playing.", "timestamp_created": 1767649183, "timestamp_updated": 1767649183, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215242359", "author": {"steamid": "76561199551573362", "personaname": "Hollow Noodles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199551573362/", "num_games_owned": 408, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 673, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19, "last_played": 1785143940, "avatar": "6a38f25709c79b285b07d740c1207140db5ad0d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Peak weather app 11/10", "timestamp_created": 1767635016, "timestamp_updated": 1767635016, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.541666686534881592", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215096564", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040761514", "personaname": "93rmw", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/93rmw/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1947, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1845, "last_played": 1767851651, "avatar": "89b79a56c6889dace54196997b9fdf1a84d3c388"}, "language": "english", "review": "fantastic game with spine tingling soundtrack and incredibly beautiful art, almost haunting, played dozens of runs and the end still sends my eyes watering", "timestamp_created": 1767508360, "timestamp_updated": 1767508360, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214962035", "author": {"steamid": "76561199203354839", "personaname": "Toasty", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199203354839/", "num_games_owned": 137, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 321, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 59, "playtime_at_review": 205, "last_played": 1791268522, "avatar": "7230d55e444c5eb37d3615668e1dad0132674830"}, "language": "english", "review": "I beat this game right after pulling one of my thigh muscles it was a worth it sacrifice", "timestamp_created": 1767392630, "timestamp_updated": 1767392630, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214875816", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073103653", "personaname": "Arkvoodle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073103653/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 232, "playtime_forever": 91, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 91, "last_played": 1759446251, "avatar": "3f2a785753533eb1ea71c82e52e5034f1c0b5144"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain: Die. Die again. Die some more. Stack weird items. Somehow become a god. Repeat. If you enjoy chaos disguised as a roguelike, this game has you covered. ⚡💀💥", "timestamp_created": 1767318224, "timestamp_updated": 1767318224, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}